        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a diverse owned, diverse targeted media business.",
        "start_character": 3841,
        "end_character": 3897
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001784254-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001784254-26-000009-bddaa8a66a861d55",
        "accession_number": "0001784254-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in two business segments: Audio (“Audio Segment”) and Video (“Video Segment”).",
        "start_character": 3078,
        "end_character": 3167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001784254-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001784254-26-000009-bddaa8a66a861d55",
        "accession_number": "0001784254-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, in a market where we own one or more radio stations, we generally cannot provide programming to another station in that market under an LMA or sell advertising on another radio station pursuant to a JSA if we could not acquire that station under the FCC’s ownership rules.",
