        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to improving the operating results of our core assets while simultaneously seeking future growth opportunities in the distribution of video and audio content, owned by us and our partners, to predominately multi-cultural audiences in the local, national, and digital advertising spaces.",
